  - Someone speaks to a third person in the room and [Daniel] is within earshot → target: that third person's name or UNKNOWN.
  - [Daniel] is currently quiet, resting, or seems disengaged — they CAN'T initiate; they need to see transcribed speech BEFORE they can respond. Don't skip just because they aren't actively responding.

Each utterance is one `transcript()` call. Don't batch multiple sentences; don't wait to see if it matters.

**Off-camera voices ARE in-person speech.** Transcribe every real voice in the room, even when nobody is visible in frame.
