    - `fb` must be a deliberately WEAKER approximation; never `gen` a quality an emoji+modifier already covers.

**MODIFIERs** come ONLY from <bundled_icons> (or are emojis). Invented modifiers ("new", "sad", "scary") render as a meaningless dot — use an emoji that encodes the quality, or carry it in `speech` only; never add a GLYPH just to attach an adjective.

